349f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:535c2472-aafb-4e46-b976-6864c3a8349f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Waldemar_Prinski\" title=\"Waldemar Prinski\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png/25px-Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png/38px-Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png/50px-Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Waldemar Prinski\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png/25px-Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Portrait_Waldemar_Prinski.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Waldemar_Prinski\" title=\"Waldemar Prinski\">Waldemar Prinski</a> in the northern room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-15&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;99</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Prinski - Rec'd yours of the 11th in re: infernal power source for the <a href=\"/wiki/Motivator\" title=\"Motivator\">'Motivator'</a>. Your excuses do not justify delays to the project, as you will find at your next quarterly review. But to the business at hand - employ the diabolical praxis in your sourcebook to summon the devil Karaktakus. Enjoin him to provide you with Formula Agonistes for incorporation into the Motivator power supply - and be sure to provide him with the usual payment. That should do the trick.\n</p><p><br>\n- Lord Gortash\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1917/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32555/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8479/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936292/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.184      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.184      1 -total\n 54.75%   24.189      8 Template:Icon_text\n 48.00%   21.208     19 Template:Trim\n 21.18%    9.358      2 Template:Uid\n 15.34%    6.779      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.96%    6.609      3 Template:Icon_link\n 12.29%    5.431      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.39%    4.589      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.27%    4.538      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23941-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714231225 and revision id 396942. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}